    "result_text": "All 291 tests pass, including the new `Cp17Tests`. \n\nThe change is implemented so that creating an owner sets `sharesHousehold` to `true` when another owner already has the same address and city, `false` otherwise, while still allowing creation:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the read-only boolean `sharesHousehold` property to the `Owner` response schema (regenerates `OwnerDto`).\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added the `sharesHousehold` field (mapped to a `shares_household` column) with getter/setter. MapStruct maps it into the DTO automatically by name.\n- **`OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`** \u2014 computes the flag before persisting via a new `sharesHousehold(owner)` helper that checks whether any existing owner has the same address and city (compared case-insensitively with whitespace normalized, reusing the existing `normalize` helper). Creation is never blocked by this rule.\n- **DB schemas** (hsqldb, h2, mysql, postgres) \u2014 added the `shares_household` column so the value persists and is returned on the subsequent `GET`.",
